{"4507900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "rAIse: Embrace the Future", "steam_appid": 4507900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4667490], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507900/extras/b77a55967d15ed79eb60552e4919248a.avif?t=1782767116\" width=1087 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans, robots, androids — all have become part of everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With advanced technology, crime has reached a new level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the streets — lawlessness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal gangs, often at war with each other:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CyberCultists</strong> — worshippers of a supercomputer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPG-Raiders</strong> — once a small gang of outcasts, now holding districts in fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the other side — powerful megacorporations:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mil-Expo</strong>, <strong>Megacore One</strong>, and the new player in the weapons market — <strong>Blain Industries</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To restore order, special units were formed — TechnoPolice &quot;<strong>TechnoCore</strong>&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modified.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the best passed the selection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tonight, as always, they answered the call...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507900/extras/4cfe0d93bd57dbabbc691d733a09bcc3.avif?t=1782767116\" width=1066 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emergency broadcast: a direct attack on the <strong>Megacore One</strong> corporate headquarters in the heart of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CyberCultists</strong> and <strong>UPG-Raiders</strong> — two rival gangs — are working together. Why would they join forces?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The elite TechnoPolice squad has been wiped out.<strong> </strong>No backup is coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command's orders: Low-level personnel do not engage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But someone has to help them...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507900/extras/24f73483f373508fb3a64410f099b226.avif?t=1782767116\" width=1100 height=203 /></span><i><strong>rAIse: Embrace the Future</strong></i> is a first-person shooter inspired by gritty near-future cyberpunk and the golden age of classic action shooters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features over 20 levels packed with intense combat, a structured narrative delivered through loading screen lore, pre-rendered cutscenes, and challenging boss encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack, recorded specifically for the game, drives the action forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built to run smoothly on low-end hardware with a fully responsive UI that adapts to any screen ratio, the game balances raw performance, accessibility, and relentless atmosphere.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507900/extras/b77a55967d15ed79eb60552e4919248a.avif?t=1782767116\" width=1087 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans, robots, androids — all have become part of everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With advanced technology, crime has reached a new level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the streets — lawlessness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal gangs, often at war with each other:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CyberCultists</strong> — worshippers of a supercomputer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPG-Raiders</strong> — once a small gang of outcasts, now holding districts in fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the other side — powerful megacorporations:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mil-Expo</strong>, <strong>Megacore One</strong>, and the new player in the weapons market — <strong>Blain Industries</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To restore order, special units were formed — TechnoPolice &quot;<strong>TechnoCore</strong>&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modified.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the best passed the selection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tonight, as always, they answered the call...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507900/extras/4cfe0d93bd57dbabbc691d733a09bcc3.avif?t=1782767116\" width=1066 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emergency broadcast: a direct attack on the <strong>Megacore One</strong> corporate headquarters in the heart of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CyberCultists</strong> and <strong>UPG-Raiders</strong> — two rival gangs — are working together. Why would they join forces?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The elite TechnoPolice squad has been wiped out.<strong> </strong>No backup is coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command's orders: Low-level personnel do not engage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But someone has to help them...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507900/extras/24f73483f373508fb3a64410f099b226.avif?t=1782767116\" width=1100 height=203 /></span><i><strong>rAIse: Embrace the Future</strong></i> is a first-person shooter inspired by gritty near-future cyberpunk and the golden age of classic action shooters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features over 20 levels 